1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was born in Piteå Landsförsamling in the year of 1714 4/5 she was married 3 times 1. marriage with kyrkoherde Johannes (Johan) Braxer in year 1735 dat. 14/6 in Åbo In this marriage she had 7 children 2 Wilhelm 
2 CONC Ross in her 2nd marridge, no children 3 Jacob Ross in Jomala in Åland she had 6 children in her 3rd marrige
2 CONT
2 CONT Sara Margareta Grundström var daughter of Israel Grundström and his wife Christina Grundel. This family had 12 children. They lived in Åbo. Among them was Sara M:s sister Anna Christina Grundström. She was born 1721 i Piteå marrie
2 CONC d to one of my ancestors Johan Korsseman born in 1712.
2 CONT
2 CONT Godparent to https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Alastalo/6000000082743432831; her father served under Israel Grundström as a hired hand during the 1720s.
2 CONT
