1 NAME Anna Pedersdotter /Walstenius/
2 GIVN Anna Pedersdotter
2 SURN Walstenius
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1580
2 ADDR
3 CITY Parainen
3 CTRY Finland
